{"seq":3,"slug":"edm-roi-cohort-analytics","title":"EDM 效果与受众分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/edm-compliance-analytics/edm-roi-cohort-analytics","wordCount":2661,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"edm-效果与受众分析\">EDM 效果与受众分析</h1><p>前面三章解决了&quot;能不能发出去&quot;，这一章解决&quot;发得值不值&quot;。它要回答的问题与前几章的工程问题性质不同：不是&quot;如何让系统按预期工作&quot;，而是&quot;如何用数据判断某条策略应该继续、调整还是停止&quot;。这套判断的难点不在计算，而在于<strong>指标口径的稳定性</strong>——同一份数据用不同口径能得出相反结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指标口径必须先定义后计算\">核心概念：指标口径必须先定义后计算</h2><p>一个 EDM 分析体系的所有争议，八成来自口径不一致。以下五个口径必须在第一次建报表时就固定下来，并写进文档。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>常见错误口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>打开率</td>\n<td>唯一打开事件</td>\n<td>送达数</td>\n<td>用发送量做分母（低估）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点击率</td>\n<td>唯一点击人数</td>\n<td>送达数</td>\n<td>用点击数而非人数（重复点击高估）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退订率</td>\n<td>退订事件</td>\n<td>送达数</td>\n<td>用打开数做分母（数值虚高数倍）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投诉率</td>\n<td>FBL 投诉数</td>\n<td>送达数（按收件方拆分）</td>\n<td>用全局送达数掩盖局部超限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转化率</td>\n<td>归因窗口内的订单</td>\n<td>送达数</td>\n<td>窗口不固定，跨期不可比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分母统一选<strong>送达数</strong>（delivered）而不是发送量，是因为未送达的邮件既不可能被打开也不可能引发退订；把未送达计入分母会稀释所有指标，且在退信率上升时制造&quot;指标变好&quot;的假象。这个选择必须贯穿全部报表。</p>\n<p>另一个必须先声明的口径是<strong>观察窗口</strong>。一封邮件发出后 24 小时的打开与 7 天内的打开差异显著，而不同活动的发送节奏不同，若一个活动用 T+1 天口径、另一个用 T+7 天口径，两者的打开率不可比较。稳妥做法是固定一个&quot;结算窗口&quot;（如 T+7 天），在此之前的报表都标注为&quot;未结算&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rfm-分层-用窗口函数把受众分成-125-格\">RFM 分层：用窗口函数把受众分成 125 格</h2><p>RFM 是直接营销里最经典的分层方法，三个维度分别是<strong>最近一次购买（Recency）</strong>、<strong>购买频次（Frequency）<strong>与</strong>消费金额（Monetary）</strong>。常见做法是把每个维度分成五个区间（五分位），三个维度交叉形成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 \\times 5 \\times 5 = 125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125</span></span></span></span></span> 个细分（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RFM_(market_research)\">Wikipedia: RFM</a>）。它的价值在于简单——不需要专门的统计软件，业务人员能直接理解，在没有其他定向手段时能带来响应率提升。</p>\n<p>把 RFM 落到 SQL 里，窗口函数是最自然的工具。窗口函数由 <code>OVER</code> 子句标识：<code>PARTITION BY</code> 把行分成组、<code>ORDER BY</code> 决定组内处理顺序（不必与查询输出顺序一致），省略 <code>PARTITION BY</code> 时全部行构成一个分区；<code>ROW_NUMBER()</code> 在分区内按窗口的 <code>ORDER BY</code> 分配序号，并列的行获得的次序是不确定的；带 <code>ORDER BY</code> 时的默认窗口框架是从分区开始到当前行（含与当前行并列的后续行），不带 <code>ORDER BY</code> 时默认框架是整个分区（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/tutorial-window.html\">PostgreSQL: Window Functions</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT s.subscriber_id,&#10;         s.country,&#10;         extract(day FROM now() - max(o.placed_at)) AS recency_days,&#10;         count(DISTINCT o.order_id)                 AS frequency,&#10;         coalesce(sum(o.amount_eur), 0)             AS monetary&#10;  FROM subscriber s&#10;  LEFT JOIN order_fact o&#10;    ON o.subscriber_id = s.subscriber_id&#10;   AND o.placed_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;730 days&#39;&#10;   AND o.status NOT IN (&#39;cancelled&#39;,&#39;refunded&#39;)&#10;  WHERE s.marketing_consent = true&#10;  GROUP BY s.subscriber_id, s.country&#10;),&#10;scored AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;    ntile(5) OVER (PARTITION BY country ORDER BY recency_days DESC) AS r_score,&#10;    ntile(5) OVER (PARTITION BY country ORDER BY frequency)         AS f_score,&#10;    ntile(5) OVER (PARTITION BY country ORDER BY monetary)          AS m_score&#10;  FROM base&#10;)&#10;SELECT subscriber_id,&#10;       r_score || f_score || m_score AS rfm_cell,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN r_score &gt;= 4 AND f_score &gt;= 4 THEN &#39;champion&#39;&#10;         WHEN r_score &gt;= 4 AND f_score &lt;= 2 THEN &#39;new_promising&#39;&#10;         WHEN r_score &lt;= 2 AND f_score &gt;= 4 THEN &#39;at_risk_highvalue&#39;&#10;         WHEN r_score &lt;= 2 AND f_score &lt;= 2 THEN &#39;hibernating&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;regular&#39;&#10;       END AS lifecycle_stage&#10;FROM scored;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">country</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         extract(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">day</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recency_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frequency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_eur</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monetary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_fact o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'730 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refunded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">marketing_consent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">country</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ntile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recency_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r_score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ntile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frequency)         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ntile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monetary)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       r_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rfm_cell,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'champion'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'new_promising'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'at_risk_highvalue'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hibernating'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'regular'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lifecycle_stage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个实现细节决定这份分层是否可用。<strong><code>PARTITION BY country</code> 是必要的</strong>：不同市场的客单价与购买周期差异极大，把德国的金额分位与日本的金额分位放在同一分布里切分，会让低价市场的所有用户都落进最低分位。<strong><code>ntile(5)</code> 而不是固定阈值</strong>：业务会增长，固定阈值（如&quot;金额 &gt; 500 为高&quot;）会在通胀或品类结构变化后失效，分位数随数据自适应。<strong><code>ORDER BY recency_days DESC</code> 的方向要小心</strong>：天数越小越近期，所以要让天数小的得到高分位，需要对天数降序做 <code>ntile</code>——方向搞反是这类 SQL 最常见的错误，且症状很隐蔽（分层看起来&quot;有结果&quot;，但 champion 段全是长期不活跃用户）。</p>\n<p>RFM 分层之后，每一段的<strong>发送策略应该不同</strong>，这正是分层的用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层</th>\n<th>典型特征</th>\n<th>建议策略</th>\n<th>不宜的做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>champion</td>\n<td>近期、高频、高额</td>\n<td>保持频率，给专属权益</td>\n<td>过度促销稀释品牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>new_promising</td>\n<td>近期、低频</td>\n<td>培养频次，引导品类扩展</td>\n<td>用同样频率轰炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>at_risk_highvalue</td>\n<td>久未购买、高价值</td>\n<td>定向唤回，独立文案</td>\n<td>纳入常规群发被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hibernating</td>\n<td>久未购买、低价值</td>\n<td>降低频率或停止营销</td>\n<td>继续高频发送（损害信誉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>regular</td>\n<td>中间分布</td>\n<td>常规营销</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>hibernating</code> 一段的处理是分层分析最有价值的产出：这批人既不买、也不互动，继续发送只会累积&quot;无效投递&quot;的比例，拉低整体信誉（见 <a href=\"../deliverability-domain/domain-reputation-warmup\">发信域名信誉与 IP 预热</a>）。降低或停止对他们的营销，往往能在不退订率的前提下改善进箱率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层迁移率-比分层快照更有用的指标\">分层迁移率：比分层快照更有用的指标</h3><p>单次的 RFM 快照只说明&quot;现在的分布&quot;，而<strong>分层之间的月度迁移率</strong>才说明趋势。要计算迁移率，必须把每月的分层结果落成快照表，再用窗口函数比较相邻两期：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 月度 RFM 快照落地后，计算各分层的净迁移&#10;CREATE TABLE rfm_snapshot (&#10;  snapshot_month DATE    NOT NULL,&#10;  subscriber_id  BIGINT  NOT NULL,&#10;  r_score SMALLINT NOT NULL, f_score SMALLINT NOT NULL, m_score SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  lifecycle_stage TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (snapshot_month, subscriber_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;SELECT prev.lifecycle_stage AS from_stage,&#10;       curr.lifecycle_stage AS to_stage,&#10;       count(*)             AS subscribers&#10;FROM rfm_snapshot prev&#10;JOIN rfm_snapshot curr&#10;  ON curr.subscriber_id = prev.subscriber_id&#10; AND curr.snapshot_month = prev.snapshot_month + interval &#39;1 month&#39;&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;ORDER BY subscribers DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 月度 RFM 快照落地后，计算各分层的净迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rfm_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_month </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subscriber_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  r_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, f_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, m_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lifecycle_stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (snapshot_month, subscriber_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lifecycle_stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_stage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       curr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lifecycle_stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_stage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscribers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rfm_snapshot prev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rfm_snapshot curr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> curr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> curr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">snapshot_month</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">snapshot_month</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 month'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscribers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关注两个方向：<code>champion → at_risk_highvalue</code> 的流量上升是预警（高价值用户正在流失），<code>new_promising → champion</code> 的转化率下降则是获客质量问题。这两个数字比任何单次活动的 ROI 更能说明平台是否健康。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cohort-留存-度量长期价值而非单次活动\">Cohort 留存：度量长期价值而非单次活动</h2><p>单次活动的 ROI 无法回答&quot;EDM 长期是否有效&quot;。Cohort（同期群）分析按用户加入的时期分组，追踪各组在后续时期的行为变化，能回答三个关键问题：新订阅者的互动度随年龄如何衰减、不同获客渠道的受众长期价值是否不同、以及降频策略是否真的降低了流失。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 以&quot;订阅月份&quot;为 cohort，按订阅后第 N 个月统计互动率&#10;WITH cohorts AS (&#10;  SELECT subscriber_id,&#10;         date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, confirmed_at) AS cohort_month&#10;  FROM subscriber&#10;  WHERE confirmed_at IS NOT NULL&#10;),&#10;activity AS (&#10;  SELECT c.cohort_month,&#10;         c.subscriber_id,&#10;         (date_part(&#39;year&#39;, e.occurred_at) - date_part(&#39;year&#39;, c.cohort_month)) * 12&#10;           + (date_part(&#39;month&#39;, e.occurred_at) - date_part(&#39;month&#39;, c.cohort_month)) AS month_index,&#10;         count(*) AS events&#10;  FROM cohorts c&#10;  JOIN engagement_event e ON e.subscriber_id = c.subscriber_id AND e.event_type = &#39;click&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2, 3&#10;)&#10;SELECT cohort_month,&#10;       month_index,&#10;       count(DISTINCT subscriber_id) FILTER (WHERE events &gt; 0) AS active_subscribers,&#10;       count(DISTINCT subscriber_id)                            AS cohort_size,&#10;       round(100.0 * count(DISTINCT subscriber_id) FILTER (WHERE events &gt; 0)&#10;             / count(DISTINCT subscriber_id), 2)                AS engagement_rate_pct&#10;FROM activity&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;HAVING month_index BETWEEN 0 AND 12&#10;ORDER BY cohort_month, month_index;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 以\"订阅月份\"为 cohort，按订阅后第 N 个月统计互动率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohorts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, confirmed_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_month</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> confirmed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">activity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (date_part(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'year'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_part(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'year'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (date_part(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_part(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> month_index,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohorts c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> engagement_event e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'click'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       month_index,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_subscribers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id)                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> engagement_rate_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> month_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_month, month_index;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解读要点：<strong><code>month_index = 0</code> 的行是基线</strong>，它的定义（当月订阅者中当月产生过点击的比例）会受订阅时间在月内分布的影响，因此 cohort 应当以&quot;月&quot;而不是&quot;周&quot;为粒度以降低噪声。<strong>曲线的形状比绝对值重要</strong>——一条在 3 个月后趋稳在 15% 的曲线，说明核心受众稳定；一条持续下滑到 2% 的曲线，说明获客质量或内容匹配度有问题。<strong>cohort 之间的对比</strong>才是决策依据：如果某个获客渠道的 cohort 在 6 个月后的互动率只有其他渠道的三分之一，那么即使它的获客成本更低，其长期价值也可能更差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发送频率与退订率的权衡曲线\">发送频率与退订率的权衡曲线</h2><p>EDM 运营中最常见的决策是&quot;要不要多发一点&quot;。这个问题有可测量的答案：绘制<strong>发送频率 vs 退订率/投诉率</strong>的曲线，找到边际收益低于边际成本的拐点。</p>\n<p>做法是按收件人分桶（如&quot;过去 30 天收到 2 封 / 4 封 / 8 封 / 12 封&quot;），统计各桶的退订率与人均收入。曲线通常呈现：低频段收入随频率上升而上升；超过某个频率后收入趋于平缓甚至下降，而退订率与投诉率持续上升。拐点位置因品类与受众而异——高频低客单品类（如快消）的拐点明显更高。</p>\n<p>必须注意这里存在<strong>选择偏差</strong>：频次高的收件人本身可能是更活跃的用户（所以他们收到了更多邮件，也更容易继续互动）。直接比较不同频率桶的退订率会把&quot;活跃度差异&quot;误读为&quot;频率影响&quot;。消除偏差的方法是<strong>在同一活跃度分层内部</strong>比较频率效应，或做一次真正的随机化实验（随机把一部分用户分配到高频组），后者的结论才可外推。这与 A/B 实验的统计要求一致（见 <a href=\"../campaign-orchestration/email-campaign-ab-schedule\">Campaign 编排与 A/B/排期</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从数据回到策略的闭环\">从数据回到策略的闭环</h2><p>分析的价值在于它能改变发送决策，因此每条指标都应当绑定一个可执行的响应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[参与度数据] --&gt; B{分群互动趋势}&#10;  B --&gt;|持续下降| C[降低频率 / 移出营销名单]&#10;  B --&gt;|稳定| D[保持当前策略]&#10;  A --&gt; E{RFM 分层迁移}&#10;  E --&gt;|champion → at_risk| F[触发唤回 campaign]&#10;  E --&gt;|new → champion| G[提升发送优先级]&#10;  A --&gt; H{渠道 cohort 对比}&#10;  H --&gt;|某渠道长期价值低| I[调整获客渠道预算]&#10;  A --&gt; J{频率-退订曲线}&#10;  J --&gt;|越过拐点| K[下调频率上限]&#10;  C --&gt; L[观测进箱率与投诉率变化]&#10;  K --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[参与度数据] --&gt; B{分群互动趋势}\n  B --&gt;|持续下降| C[降低频率 / 移出营销名单]\n  B --&gt;|稳定| D[保持当前策略]\n  A --&gt; E{RFM 分层迁移}\n  E --&gt;|champion → at_risk| F[触发唤回 campaign]\n  E --&gt;|new → champion| G[提升发送优先级]\n  A --&gt; H{渠道 cohort 对比}\n  H --&gt;|某渠道长期价值低| I[调整获客渠道预算]\n  A --&gt; J{频率-退订曲线}\n  J --&gt;|越过拐点| K[下调频率上限]\n  C --&gt; L[观测进箱率与投诉率变化]\n  K --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; A</pre><p>这个闭环的每一段都需要一个<strong>基线</strong>才能判断&quot;变化&quot;。建立基线的方式是在不变更策略的情况下观测至少一个完整的购买周期（对低客单品类是几周，对高客单品类是几个月）。没有基线的团队会把季节性波动误认为策略效果——这是 EDM 分析里最昂贵的一类错误，因为它会导致一个正确的策略被错误回滚。</p>\n<h3 id=\"日报与季度复盘的分层\">日报与季度复盘的分层</h3><p>不是所有指标都值得每天看。日报应当只包含能触发动作的少数指标：发送量、送达率、投诉率、硬退信率。周报加入点击率、退订率、分群对比。月报加入 RFM 分层迁移与 cohort 曲线。季度复盘则是回到策略层——获客渠道的长期价值、频率上限是否该调整、哪些分层应该退出营销名单。</p>\n<p>把低频指标放进日报会造成两个问题：指标波动被过度解读（小样本噪声被当作趋势），以及真正需要注意的日级指标被淹没在信息里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>所有指标必须先固定口径再计算：分母统一用送达数；退订率与投诉率的分母口径差异会造成数倍误差；投诉率必须按收件方拆分。</li>\n<li>归因窗口必须固定并标注；未结算数据要显式标记。</li>\n<li>RFM 用 <code>ntile(5)</code> 分位而非固定阈值，且必须按国家分区，否则跨市场不可比；<code>recency_days</code> 的排序方向是最常见的隐蔽错误。</li>\n<li>RFM 分层的价值在于它对每段给出不同策略；<code>hibernating</code> 段降频或停发往往改善整体进箱率。</li>\n<li>Cohort 分析以月为粒度看长期互动衰减与渠道价值差异，曲线形状比绝对值重要。</li>\n<li>发送频率与退订率的权衡存在选择偏差，同层内比较或随机化实验才可外推。</li>\n<li>每条指标都应绑定可执行响应，且必须先建立不变策略的基线，否则会把季节性波动误认为策略效果。</li>\n<li>日报只放能触发动作的指标，低频指标放到周/月/季度层级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：指标口径中的打开率失真见 <a href=\"open-click-conversion-track\">打开/点击/转化追踪</a>；频率上限与发送排期的工程参数见 <a href=\"../campaign-orchestration/email-campaign-ab-schedule\">Campaign 编排与 A/B/排期</a>；互动衰减如何影响域名信誉见 <a href=\"../deliverability-domain/domain-reputation-warmup\">发信域名信誉与 IP 预热</a>；分群规则的建模方式见 <a href=\"../subscriber-audience-seg/audience-segment-import\">受众分群与名单导入</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"EDM 效果与受众分析","id":"edm-效果与受众分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：指标口径必须先定义后计算","id":"核心概念-指标口径必须先定义后计算"},{"level":2,"text":"RFM 分层：用窗口函数把受众分成 125 格","id":"rfm-分层-用窗口函数把受众分成-125-格"},{"level":3,"text":"分层迁移率：比分层快照更有用的指标","id":"分层迁移率-比分层快照更有用的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"Cohort 留存：度量长期价值而非单次活动","id":"cohort-留存-度量长期价值而非单次活动"},{"level":2,"text":"发送频率与退订率的权衡曲线","id":"发送频率与退订率的权衡曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"从数据回到策略的闭环","id":"从数据回到策略的闭环"},{"level":3,"text":"日报与季度复盘的分层","id":"日报与季度复盘的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"打开/点击/转化追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/edm-compliance-analytics/open-click-conversion-track"},"next":null}